---
/** Six small things we sweat. Each tile demonstrates its own detail on hover or focus. */
---

<section class="details paper" aria-labelledby="details-title">
  <div class="details__wrap">
    <header class="details__head">
      <p class="eyebrow">The details</p>
      <h2 id="details-title" class="details__title display">
        <span class="line-mask"><span data-split-line>Nobody notices them.</span></span>
        <span class="line-mask"><span data-split-line>Until they’re missing.</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p class="details__lede" data-reveal>
        Six of the hundreds of small decisions behind every site we ship. Hover or tab through them.
      </p>
    </header>

    <ul class="details__grid" role="list">
      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-optical" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="demo-optical__btn"><svg viewBox="0 0 40 40"><path d="M15 11 29 20 15 29Z"></path></svg></span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Optical alignment</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">A triangle centered by the numbers looks off-center. We nudge it until it looks right.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-hang" aria-hidden="true">
          <p class="demo-hang__quote"><span class="demo-hang__mark">“</span>First impressions are made in milliseconds.”</p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Hanging punctuation</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">Quote marks sit outside the text edge, so the left margin stays perfectly straight.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-cls" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="demo-cls__frame"><span class="demo-cls__img"></span><span class="demo-cls__line"></span><span class="demo-cls__line demo-cls__line--short"></span></div>
          <p class="demo-cls__score">CLS <b class="tnum">0.00</b></p>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Zero layout shift</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">Images reserve their space before they load, so nothing jumps while you read.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-tnum" aria-hidden="true">
          <div class="demo-tnum__col"><span>$1,111.11</span><span>$8,409.50</span><span>$2,999.00</span></div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Tabular figures</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">Digits that line up in columns make prices and stats easy to compare at a glance.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-focus" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="demo-focus__btn">Book a consultation</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Focus you can see</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">Keyboard users always know where they are. Accessibility is part of the build, never a patch.</p>
      </li>

      <li class="tile" tabindex="0" data-reveal>
        <div class="tile__demo demo-schema" aria-hidden="true">
          <pre class="demo-schema__code"><span class="k">"@type"</span>: <span class="s">"LocalBusiness"</span>,
<span class="k">"name"</span>: <span class="s">"Your business"</span>,
<span class="k">"areaServed"</span>: <span class="s">"Miami"</span>,
<span class="k">"openingHours"</span>: <span class="s">"Mo-Sa 08:00-18:00"</span></pre>
        </div>
        <h3 class="tile__title">Structured data</h3>
        <p class="tile__text">Schema markup tells Google exactly who you are, where you are and when you’re open.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .details {
    padding-block: var(--space-3xl);
  }

  .details__wrap {
    max-width: var(--max);
    margin-inline: auto;
    padding-left: var(--gutter);
    padding-right: var(--gutter-r);
  }

  .details__head {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-s);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-xl);
  }

  .details__title {
    font-size: var(--step-5);
  }

  .details__lede {
    max-width: 44ch;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .details__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1px;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    background: var(--line-strong);
    border: 1px solid var(--line-strong);
  }

  .tile {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto auto 1fr;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    padding: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 36px);
    background: var(--bg);
    outline-offset: -3px;
  }

  .tile__demo {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    height: clamp(150px, 15vw, 200px);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-s);
    background: #e9e6ef;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .tile__title {
    font-size: var(--step-2);
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .tile__text {
    color: var(--text-mute);
    max-width: 38ch;
  }

  /* Optical alignment */
  .demo-optical__btn {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 84px;
    height: 84px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--ink);
  }

  .demo-optical__btn svg {
    width: 40px;
    fill: var(--paper);
    transform: translateX(-3px);
    transition: transform 0.6s var(--ease-snap);
  }

  .tile:hover .demo-optical__btn svg,
  .tile:focus-visible .demo-optical__btn svg {
    transform: translateX(0.5px);
  }

  /* Hanging punctuation */
  .demo-hang__quote {
    position: relative;
    width: 72%;
    padding-left: 0;
    border-left: 2px solid #b81e52;
    padding-inline-start: 14px;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .demo-hang__mark {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: margin 0.6s var(--ease-snap);
  }

  .tile:hover .demo-hang__mark,
  .tile:focus-visible .demo-hang__mark {
    margin-left: -0.42em;
  }

  /* Layout shift */
  .demo-cls {
    gap: 0.6rem;
  }

  .demo-cls__frame {
    display: grid;
    gap: 8px;
    width: 64%;
    padding: 12px;
    background: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 10px 30px -18px rgb(20 17 28 / 0.4);
  }

  .demo-cls__img {
    display: block;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, #e2dee9 30%, #f4f2f7 50%, #e2dee9 70%) 0 0 / 200% 100%;
    animation: shimmer 1.8s linear infinite;
  }

  .tile:hover .demo-cls__img,
  .tile:focus-visible .demo-cls__img {
    animation: none;
    background: var(--sun);
  }

  .demo-cls__line {
    height: 7px;
    background: #d9d4e2;
  }

  .demo-cls__line--short {
    width: 60%;
  }

  .demo-cls__score {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text-mute);
  }

  .demo-cls__score b {
    color: #16794a;
  }

  @keyframes shimmer {
    to { background-position: -200% 0; }
  }

  /* Tabular figures */
  .demo-tnum__col {
    display: grid;
    justify-items: end;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 650;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 1.8vw, 1.6rem);
    font-variant-numeric: proportional-nums;
    transition: none;
  }

  .tile:hover .demo-tnum__col,
  .tile:focus-visible .demo-tnum__col {
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  /* Focus */
  .demo-focus__btn {
    padding: 0.9rem 1.3rem;
    background: var(--ink);
    color: var(--paper);
    font-weight: 600;
    outline: 2px solid transparent;
    outline-offset: 0;
    transition:
      outline-color 0.3s ease,
      outline-offset 0.4s var(--ease-snap);
  }

  .tile:hover .demo-focus__btn,
  .tile:focus-visible .demo-focus__btn {
    outline-color: #b81e52;
    outline-offset: 5px;
  }

  /* Schema */
  .demo-schema__code {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
    font-size: clamp(0.66rem, 0.9vw, 0.78rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: #3f3a4c;
    white-space: pre;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .demo-schema__code .k {
    color: #b81e52;
  }

  .demo-schema__code .s {
    color: #16794a;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .details__grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .details__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
